{"edition": "v260607", "edition_behind": true, "errata": [{"description": "The upstream README's errata section says the data-collection inference under \"Motive one\" on page 13 is wrong. Hermes Agent's official FAQ says it collects no telemetry or usage data and keeps conversations, memory, and skills on the user's machine, so the chain from users' real usage to Nous's training data breaks at its first link. The erratum adds that the data-flywheel argument later in the section falls with it, while the Portal and OpenClaw motives still stand. The Chinese edition v261020 corrects the text. This chapter keeps the English v260607 text as printed.", "source_url": "https://github.com/alchaincyf/hermes-agent-orange-book/blob/b6e53a8e11e00c8b14b2f72d6b4f1ce71fef6692/README.md#errata"}], "extraction_status": "machine-extracted", "id": "hermes-agent-orange-book/why-nous-built-this", "language": "en", "license_id": "MIT", "mirror_status": "mirrored", "newer_editions": [{"language": "zh", "version": "v261020"}], "order": 3, "part": "Part 1: What It Is", "path": "books/hermes-agent-orange-book/chapters/03-why-nous-built-this.md", "quote_permitted": true, "resource": "hermes-agent-orange-book", "section_label": "§03", "source": {"pages": {"first": 12, "last": 16}, "path": "Hermes-Agent-The-Complete-Guide-v260607.pdf", "repository": "alchaincyf/hermes-agent-orange-book", "revision": "b6e53a8e11e00c8b14b2f72d6b4f1ce71fef6692"}, "title": "Why Nous Built This", "topics": []}
